<Document style="helpdocument">
	<p style="htitle">Sea Farm</p>
	<p style="hp">Sea farms grow food and goods from the sea, consuming labor, water, and energy.</p>
	<p style="hp">Must be built entirely on water tiles (lake, river, or pond).</p>

  <p style="hp">This is a sea farm</p>
   <img src="images/tiles/seafarm0.png" halign="center"/>

  <p style="hp">and this its icon</p>
   <img src="images/gui/buttonpanel/parks/seafarm.png" halign="center"/>

	<p style="hsubtitle">Formulas</p>
	<p style="hp">180 labor + 200 lo-volt + 10 water => 350 food + 8 goods</p>
	<p style="hp">Production scales proportionally with available labor.</p>

